sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Caller
    participant X as XStructuredRunnable
    participant M as Wrapped Runnable
    participant D as StreamDecoder

    UI->>X: stream(input)
    X->>M: stream(prepared input)
    loop every chunk
        M-->>X: chunk
        X->>D: feed(text)
        D-->>X: events
        X-->>UI: TEXT_DELTA<br/>STRUCTURED_*
    end
    X->>D: finalize()
    X-->>UI: RESULT
    Note over X,D: The payload is validated once,<br/>as soon as the envelope closes.